as you came in.

00:23:17.200 --> 00:23:20.501
It would seem -- Now, do you
ever think before a night,

00:23:20.501 --> 00:23:22.200
"Hey, I might see something
I really like.

00:23:22.200 --> 00:23:24.634
I should wear shoes
that are easy to get off"?

00:23:24.634 --> 00:23:27.567
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:23:27.567 --> 00:23:29.300
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:23:29.300 --> 00:23:30.934
I mean, I'll say this.

00:23:30.934 --> 00:23:32.968
If I -- If I -- the next time
