00:23:32.968 --> 00:23:34.367
I'm just gonna wear Crocs,

00:23:34.367 --> 00:23:36.000
'cause I want to get them --
get them off.

00:23:36.000 --> 00:23:37.400
[ Laughter ]
They're soft.

00:23:37.400 --> 00:23:39.200
If I should accidentally hit you
in the head, you'll be fine.

00:23:39.200 --> 00:23:40.567
-Maybe I should carry one
in my purse.

00:23:40.567 --> 00:23:42.434
-[ Laughing ] Yeah, exactly.
Well, that would be great.

00:23:42.434 --> 00:23:43.567
A purse shoe --
that's what you need.

00:23:43.567 --> 00:23:44.834
[ Laughter ]
-A purse shoe.

00:23:44.834 --> 00:23:46.100
-And then people will say,
"Did Jennifer like you?"

00:23:46.100 --> 00:23:47.300
And they'll say,
"Well, she threw a shoe,

00:23:47.300 --> 00:23:48.501
but it was in her purse."
-"She threw a shoe."

00:23:48.501 --> 00:23:49.601
Right, right.
-Yeah.

00:23:49.601 --> 00:23:51.434
You always have
great judges on the show.

00:23:51.434 --> 00:23:54.267
And then you have had --
Rihanna has come on

00:23:54.267 --> 00:23:55.634
