00:24:21.734 --> 00:24:23.167
Why would somebody
on "The Voice" ask about me?

00:24:23.167 --> 00:24:24.334
That doesn't make sense.
-I don't know.

00:24:24.334 --> 00:24:25.968
[ Laughter ]

00:24:25.968 --> 00:24:27.167
She's really cool.

00:24:27.167 --> 00:24:29.901
I actually was --
I was nervous about that, too,

00:24:29.901 --> 00:24:31.934
because it's like,
it's one thing

00:24:31.934 --> 00:24:35.934
