you know?

00:25:13.100 --> 00:25:15.968
I mean, why not?
-Right. Yeah.

00:25:15.968 --> 00:25:17.667
-I mean, I'm a perfect match
for Rihanna.

00:25:17.667 --> 00:25:19.200
-Yeah.
[ Laughter ]

00:25:19.200 --> 00:25:22.534
-And so, I was coming up
with our, like --

00:25:22.534 --> 00:25:23.901
our couple name, and...
-Oh, right.

00:25:23.901 --> 00:25:26.901
-...Blihanna was one of them.
-Blihanna. That's good.

00:25:26.901 --> 00:25:30.133
-And I tried Rake. And that --
-That doesn't work.

00:25:30.133 --> 00:25:32.234
Yeah, Blihanna --
-Actually, neither one of them.

00:25:32.234 --> 00:25:33.868
-They're not great, but of
the two, Blihanna's better.

00:25:33.868 --> 00:25:35.968
It's interesting you say
flirting with her,

00:25:35.968 --> 00:25:37.467
because she's one of
those people that,

00:25:37.467 --> 00:25:38.801
because she did "SNL"

00:25:38.801 --> 00:25:40.234
and she did music a bunch of
times when I was there,

00:25:40.234 --> 00:25:41.501
and I remember once
walking by in the hallway,

00:25:41.501 --> 00:25:42.734
