"Hey, how's it going?"

00:25:42.734 --> 00:25:44.968
And I think I said like
[Babbles indistinctly]

00:25:44.968 --> 00:25:48.133
[ Laughter ]

00:25:48.133 --> 00:25:49.934
So, I think if she was
asking about me,

00:25:49.934 --> 00:25:51.767
she might have been saying,
"Is he brain damaged?"

00:25:51.767 --> 00:25:54.400
-[ Speaking indistinctly ]
You never get over the stroke.

00:25:54.400 --> 00:25:55.234
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:25:55.234 --> 00:25:59.801
♪♪

